<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;</span></font><span style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial" style="">{!Contact.FirstName}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></font></span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Your blood drive
is coming up, and every donation is vital because hospital patients are
counting on lifesaving blood products from your drive. We are grateful for your
kindness and commitment to helping those in need.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Along with Warner
Bros. Discovery, </span><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin;color:#242424;background:white">we’re diving into the </span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">35th anniversary of <i>Shark Week </i>and the
theatrical release of <i>Meg 2: The Trench</i> and invite you and your donors
to dive in to help save lives.<b> <o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">We’ve got a MEGA
prizes for donors to sink their teeth into!</span></b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">
<b>When donors come to give July 12-Aug. 12, they’ll be automatically entered
for a chance to win a three-night New York getaway for two with a private shark
dive adventure at Long Island Aquarium!^^ PLUS, when they come give July 17-31
they’ll receive an exclusive Shark Week T-shirt, while supplies last!^ <o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Don’t be
cold-blooded: Fill your blood drive schedule today.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">As you
continue the work to make your drive a success – remember to use these tips:</span></b></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
     normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
     minor-latin">Fill your schedule</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">. Use these<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/manage-my-blood-drive/blood-drive-coordinator-toolkit/tips-tools-for-recruiting-donors/coordinator-toolkit---tips-and-tools.html">
     tools</a> to recruit blood donors and schedule them using the <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/account-login.html">Blood Drive
     Management Portal</a>. <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
     normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
     minor-latin">Encourage donors to schedule a donation for a friend</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">.
     Each additional donor scheduled means more lives saved!<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal">IMPORTANT: Donors
MUST have a valid email address on file to receive their reward.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></b><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.OwnerFullName}</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">P.S. </span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Each Red Cross blood drive and donation center
follows a </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/dlp/share-your-health.html"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;color:red">high
standard of safety</span></b></a><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"> and infection control to protect our
partners, donors and staff. </span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.25in; background: white;"><b><i><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><i><span style="font-size:9.0pt">^Offer applicable to
presenting donors only during the following dates: 07/17/2023-07/31/2023 and
while supplies last. Offer subject to availability of donation opportunities in
presenting donor’s area. No substitutions and not transferable by presenting
donor. Not redeemable for cash.<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><i><span style="font-size:9.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><i><span style="font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">^^Void where
prohibited. Void in Puerto Rico, any U.S. territories and outside the United
States and where prohibited by law. Open to legal residents of U.S. states and
DC, age 18+ (19+ in NE and AL; 21+ in MS) at entry. Begins 12:00 a.m. ET on
07/12/23; ends 11:59 p.m. ET on 08/12/23.&nbsp;<b style="">NO PURCHASE OR DONATION
NECESSARY</b>. To enter either present to donate blood at an American Red Cross
blood donation facility or send an email to&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style="font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><a href="mailto:customercare@redcross.org"><span style="color: rgb(0, 69, 126); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">customercare@redcross.org</span></a><span style="color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;and include the Giveaway name, "American Red
Cross 2023&nbsp;</span></span></i><em><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-style: normal;">Meg 2: The Trench</span></em><i><span style="font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;Giveaway." There is a limit of five (5) total
Entries permitted per Entrant, regardless of method of Entry, during the
Giveaway Period. One (1) prize will be awarded to one (1) winner. Winner will
receive one (1) double occupancy hotel room for three (3) nights, round-trip
airfare (unless local) for two (2) to New York with one (1) day entry to the
Long Island Aquarium for two (2) and private shark dive adventure. Total ARV of
all prize elements: $9,000. Odds of winning depend on number of entries
received. Full rules&nbsp;<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/local-homepage/events/shark-week.html" title="https://www.redcrossblood.org/local-homepage/events/shark-week.html"><span style="color:#00457E">click here</span></a>. Sponsor: American Red Cross.
©&nbsp;</span></i><em><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-style: normal;">Meg 2: The
Trench</span></em><i><span style="font-size: 9pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;2023
Warner Bros. Ent. All Rights Reserved.</span></i></span><i><span style="font-size:
9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>]]></td>
